
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### 2. Habilitar 2FA
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/2fa/enable

### 3. Confirmar 2FA con código de autenticador
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/2fa/confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "071114"
}

### 4. Ver estado de 2FA
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/2fa/status

### 5. Deshabilitar 2FA
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/2fa/disable

### 6. Logout
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/logout


### 7. Login inicial
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### 8. Verificar código 2FA durante login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/2fa/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "code": "123456"
}

### 9. Logout
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/logout
